OL,3,GNEWSATeacher 'orchestrated' rape of
OL,4,Aboy, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details.
OL,9,FA former boarding school teacher
OL,10,F"orchestrated" the rape of a boy by a
OL,11,Ffellow pupil, a court has been told.
OL,13,FDerek Barker, 92, denies eight sexual
OL,14,Foffences against four boys at Monkton
OL,15,FCombe School in Bath, Somerset, where
OL,16,Fhe taught in the 1970s and 1980s.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
