OL,3,GNEWSATeacher 'orchestrated' rape of
OL,4,Aboy, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors at Bristol Crown Court heard
OL,7,Fevidence from the first complainant who
OL,8,Ftold police another pupil told him to
OL,9,Fattend Barker's private flat within the
OL,10,Fschool grounds where he was sexually
OL,11,Fabused by an older boy while the
OL,12,Fdefendant allegedly watched.
